{"work_id": "MX5-007", "matched_key": "不要四面出击", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "不要四面出击1一九五年六月六日七届二中全会以来我们党领导的新民主主义革命在全国范围内取得了胜利成立了中华人民共和国这是一个伟大的胜利是中国从古未有的大胜利也是十月革命以后一个带世界性的大胜利斯大林同志和许多外国同志都感觉中国革命的胜利是极其伟大的我们有许多同志因为在这个斗争中搞惯了反而不那样感觉关于中国革命胜利的伟大意义我们还要在党内和群众中间做广泛的宣传在伟大胜利的形势下我们面前还有很复杂的斗争还有许多困难我们已经在北方约有一亿六千万人口的地区完成了土地改革要肯定这", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-82fa37116043841dbfe3", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/c01.pdf", "raw_sha256": "3b57bec20dabe65cf0faf8b94e80ce521a59582ab39aa764c9b5c8e0de2380ef", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-old-13", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 440, "end": 440, "record_path": "archive/records/A-82fa37116043841dbfe3.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-82fa37116043841dbfe3.txt", "source_title": "建国以来毛泽东文稿(1)", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "wengao", "id": "C-81e09414d3d2bb1c", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
